      code-referenced key is declared in GeneralSettings.strings (referenced==declared
      verified); NO English literal in native code (all via the facade + Text(verbatim:)).
  - Accessibility: VoiceOver labels on every control (each select/stepper/text/number/
      currency field, the freshness chip with spoken value, sync + discard + save + toast
      close buttons); banners + panels carry combined values; Dynamic Type system fonts
      (Font.TS); Reduce-Motion honored (TSSkeleton shimmer, chip spin, FadeIn).
